  "ceremony": {
    "name": "Device lifecycle (wallet and agent)",
    "channel": "proposed",
    "choreography": "docs/26-paired-ceremonies.md section 5: register, heartbeat, list, set-wake and the wallet's remove flow (wipe then revoke); negatives for a repeated register, a heartbeat or wake before register, an unknown wipe target and a replay"
